---
# Everything this script names is a file beside the gallery: a picture, a font, a puppet.
setting: {image: ../../examples/gallery/art/street.png}
lettering: {font: ../../examples/gallery/fonts/ComicNeue-Regular.ttf}
cast:
  ALICE: {reference: alice, at: left_third}
  PIP: {reference: ../../examples/gallery/puppets/pip.puppet.yaml, at: right_third}
---
PANEL 1
ALICE
Hello, Pip.

PANEL 2
PIP
Hello.
